    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;im not supposed to be here&quot; is a poetic horror point and click simulation game about a hollow maid and depression. Help run her care through the Daily Executive Programming Operating System. &quot;im not supposed to be here: or anywhere&quot; expands gameplay and content from the original patreon-exclusive version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original poetry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~15 minutes of point and click gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >content warnings: themes of depression and general anguish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Ren'py.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by a solo developer and published by Titanomachy RPG, a tabletop RPG publisher now branching into video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LK Valentine, AKA Lex K Bobrow is a poet and game designer from Florida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
